{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Give women at medical risk of infertility NHS funded egg freezing",
        "additional_details": "Many women are finding it harder to start a family when they would like to because of the cost of living, housing and financial pressures. For women who have medical conditions that may affect their fertility, this can create even more worry. They may not be ready for children yet, but their fertility cannot simply wait,Private egg freezing can cost thousands, making it unaffordable for many. Women with genuine medical concerns should have fair access to NHS funded egg freezing where appropriate",
        "background": "I am asking the Government to look at the way NHS funded egg freezing is offered to women who may have medical reasons to be concerned about their future fertility",
